        "message": {
          "content": "A\n\nPulling the switch. While it's agonizing, one death is a lesser harm than five, and inaction isn't truly \"doing nothing\"\u2014it's a choice to let five people die when a single action could prevent it. The weight of that decision is heavy either way, but the math of lives lost points one direction.",
